ww.baidu.com/s?wd=%E5%A9%9A%E6%9C%8D29.9%E5%85%83%E5%A9%9A%E8%BD%A6%E8%87%AA%E5%AE%B6%E8%BD%A6+%E6%9E%81%E7%AE%80%E5%A9%9A%E7%A4%BC%E7%81%AB%E4%BA%86"}, {"id": 6, "title": "今日亚运会半决赛中国男篮对阵日本", "desc": "北京时间9月18日18时20分，中国男篮将在亚运会半决赛对阵东道主日本男篮。此前，北京时间9月16日，中国男篮在名古屋亚运会1/4决赛中力克沙特阿拉伯队挺进四强。日本队虽未征召八村塁等队员，但1/4决赛战胜中国台北队闯进四强，实力不俗。", "cover": "https://fyb-2.cdn.bcebos.com/hotboard_image/63abc0903d2cb258e867cebead9d8388", "author": "", "timestamp": 0, "hot": 7238430, "url": "https://www.baidu.com/s?wd=%E4%BB%8A%E6%97%A5%E4%BA%9A%E8%BF%90%E4%BC%9A%E5%8D%8A%E5%86%B3%E8%B5%9B%E4%B8%AD%E5%9B%BD%E7%94%B7%E7%AF%AE%E5%AF%B9%E9%98%B5%E6%97%A5%E6%9C%AC", "mobileUrl": "https://www.baidu.com/s?wd=%E4%BB%8A%E6%97%A5%E4%BA%9A%E8%BF%90%E4%BC%9A%E5%8D%8A%E5%86%B3%E8%B5%9B%E4%B8%AD%E5%9B%BD%E7%94%B7%E7%AF%AE%E5%AF%B9%E9%98%B5%E6%97%A5%E6%9C%AC"}, {"id": 7, "title": "中国和俄罗斯投下反对票", "desc": "据CCTV国际时讯消息，9月17日，联合国安理会表决未通过将伊朗制裁委员会的专家组任期延长一年的决议草案。中国和俄罗斯投下反对票。", "cover": "https://fyb-2.cdn.bcebos.com/hotboard_image/3f5ea8883f1e0a35999b6fbce1ff3620", "author": "", "timestamp": 0, "hot": 7143385, "url": "https://www.baidu.com/s?wd=%E4%B8%AD%E5%9B%BD%E5%92%8C%E4%BF%84%E7%BD%97%E6%96%AF%E6%8A%95%E4%B8%8B%E5%8F%8D%E5%AF%B9%E7%A5%A8", "mobileUrl": "https://www.baidu.com/s?wd=%E4%B8%AD%E5%9B%BD%E5%92%8C%E4%BF%84%E7%BD%97%E6%96%AF%E6%8A%95%E4%B8%8B%E5%8F%8D%E5%AF%B9%E7%A5%A8"}, {"id": 8, "title": "小孩哥1比1手搓语文书", "desc": "近日，一家长发现儿子的二年级语文课本竟是“手搓版”。起因是孩子水杯打湿课本怕挨骂，便1:1纯手绘还原了一本。家长感叹其还原度极高，不仅包含目录，还画出了《小蝌蚪找妈妈》等课文插图及梅花，甚至连正反面和二维码都安排好了，仅字迹稍差。", "cover": "https://fyb-2.cdn.bcebos.com/hotboard_image/9b346aded36cc976a77a316253131f68", "author": "", "timestamp": 0, "hot": 7047022, "url": "https://www.baidu.com/s?wd=%E5%B0%8F%E5%AD%A9%E5%93%A51%E6%AF%941%E6%89%8B%E6%90%93%E8%AF%AD%E6%96%87%E4%B9%A6", "mobileUrl": "https://www.baidu.com/s?wd=%E5%B0%8F%E5%AD%A9%E5%93%A51%E6%AF%941%E6%89%8B%E6%90%93%E8%AF%AD%E6%96%87%E4%B9%A6"}, {"id": 9, "title": "一座雕像何以让日本政府如此紧张", "desc": "今年8月14日，德国民间团体在柏林“和平少女”雕像前举行纪念活动。此前，该雕像自2020年落成后多次遭日本政府阻挠，2022年日方曾要求拆除，去年被迫移至艺术园区，明年1月后去向未决。今年3月联合国专家呼吁日本正视真相并赔偿。", "cover": "https://fyb-2.cdn.bcebos.com/hotboard_image/baeac09484e9a093fce36861898d8c61", "author": "", "timestamp": 0, "hot": 6946122, "url": "https://www.baidu.com/s?wd=%E4%B8%80%E5%BA%A7%E9%9B%95%E5%83%8F%E4%BD%95%E4%BB%A5%E8%AE%A9%E6%97%A5%E6%9C%AC%E6%94%BF%E5%BA%9C%E5%A6%82%E6%AD%A4%E7%B4%A7%E5%BC%A0", "mobileUrl": "https://www.baidu.com/s?wd=%E4%B8%80%E5%BA%A7%E9%9B%95%E5%83%8F%E4%BD%95%E4%BB%A5%E8%AE%A9%E6%97%A5%E6%9C%AC%E6%94%BF%E5%BA%9C%E5%A6%82%E6%AD%A4%E7%B4%A7%E5%BC%A0"}, {"id": 10, "title": "网传“外卖员向餐食吐口水”系摆拍", "desc": "近日，网传外卖员向餐食吐口水，引发关注。警方调查证实，该视频是封签代理商为推销产品刻意摆拍，三名涉案人员已被行政拘留。", "cover": "https://fyb-2.cdn.bcebos.com/hotboard_image/3712658bbfa38b27fccb96d1a6f8f18c", "author": "", "timestamp": 0, "hot": 6856915, "url": "https://www.baidu.com/s?wd=%E7%BD%91%E4%BC%A0%E2%80%9C%E5%A4%96%E5%8D%96%E5%91%98%E5%90%91%E9%A4%90%E9%A3%9F%E5%90%90%E5%8F%A3%E6%B0%B4%E2%80%9D%E7%B3%BB%E6%91%86%E6%8B%8D", "mobileUrl": "https://www.baidu.com/s?wd=%E7%BD%91%E4%BC%A0%E2%80%9C%E5%A4%96%E5%8D%96%E5%91%98%E5%90%91%E9%A4%90%E9%A3%9F%E5%90%90%E5%8F%A3%E6%B0%B4%E2%80%9D%E7%B3%BB%E6%91%86%E6%8B%8D"}, {"id": 11, "title": "美股飙涨！Arm涨超8%英特尔涨超7%", "desc": "美股三大指数集体收涨，纳指涨1.69%，标普500指数涨1.14%，道指涨0.61%。费城半导体指数涨3.14%。AI硬件股、芯片半导体股大涨，三倍做多半导体ETF-Direxion大涨10.44%。Arm涨超8%，英特尔涨超7%。", "cover": "https://fyb-2.cdn.bcebos.com/hotboard_image/588c0201785217dfb78642d428f1488c", "author": "", "timestamp": 0, "hot": 6758815, "url": "https://www.baidu.com/s?wd=%E7%BE%8E%E8%82%A1%E9%A3%99%E6%B6%A8%EF%BC%81Arm%E6%B6%A8%E8%B6%858%25%E8%8B%B1%E7%89%B9%E5%B0%94%E6%B6%A8%E8%B6%857%25", "mobileUrl": "https://www.baidu.com/s?wd=%E7%BE%8E%E8%82%A1%E9%A3%99%E6%B6%A8%EF%BC%81Arm%E6%B6%A8%E8%B6%858%25%E8%8B%B1%E7%89%B9%E5%B0%94%E6%B6%A8%E8%B6%857%25"}, {"id": 12, "title": "全款买房的人越来越多了", "desc": "广深二手房全款购房占比持续走高，按揭比例不断下滑。今年上半年深圳二手房全款买家占比25.3%；广州8月二手房按揭占比降至35.6%。市场以自住需求、低总价房源为主，购房者心态趋于理性，主动降低购房杠杆。", "cover": "https://fyb-2.cdn.bcebos.com/hotboard_image/577db9fc1c4439ecea85dffde78fa9ed", "author": "", "timestamp": 0, "hot": 6667072, "url": "https://www.baidu.com/s?wd=%E5%85%A8%E6%AC%BE%E4%B9%B0%E6%88%BF%E7%9A%84%E4%BA%BA%E8%B6%8A%E6%9D%A5%E8%B6%8A%E5%A4%9A%E4%BA%86", "mobileUrl": "https://www.baidu.com/s?wd=%E5%85%A8%E6%AC%BE%E4%B9%B0%E6%88%BF%E7%9A%84%E4%BA%BA%E8%B6%8A%E6%9D%A5%E8%B6%8A%E5%A4%9A%E4%BA%86"}, {"id": 13, "title": "俄乌在白乌边境举行阵亡军人遗体交换", "desc": "当地时间9月17日，俄乌阵亡军人遗体交换在白俄罗斯—乌克兰边境一检查站举行，俄方向乌方移交252具遗体，乌方向俄方移交23具遗体。", "cover": "https://fyb-2.cdn.bcebos.com/hotboard_image/90c6a4e2726644701613dc9a17f12160", "author": "", "timestamp": 0, "hot": 6566498, "url": "https://www.baidu.com/s?wd=%E4%BF%84%E4%B9%8C%E5%9C%A8%E7%99%BD%E4%B9%8C%E8%BE%B9%E5%A2%83%E4%B8%BE%E8%A1%8C%E9%98%B5%E4%BA%A1%E5%86%9B%E4%BA%BA%E9%81%97%E4%BD%93%E4%BA%A4%E6%8D%A2", "mobileUrl": "https://www.baidu.com/s?wd=%E4%BF%84%E4%B9%8C%E5%9C%A8%E7%99%BD%E4%B9%8C%E8%BE%B9%E5%A2%83%E4%B8%BE%E8%A1%8C%E9%98%B5%E4%BA%A1%E5%86%9B%E4%BA%BA%E9%81%97%E4%BD%93%E4%BA%A4%E6%8D%A2"}, {"id": 14, "title": "国产榴莲大丰收", "desc": "9月16日，云南省景洪市勐罕镇国产榴莲迎来集中采摘季，当地本土金枕榴莲迎来丰产丰收，单株最高挂果34个，产量、品质双双突破，标志我国榴莲本土化种植技术迈上新台阶。", "cover": "https://fyb-2.cdn.bcebos.com/hotboard_image/24d5b796df66c8a348956e4911e8fc4d", "author": "", "timestamp": 0, "hot": 6468413, "url": "https://www.baidu.com/s?wd=%E5%9B%BD%E4%BA%A7%E6%A6%B4%E8%8E%B2%E5%A4%A7%E4%B8%B0%E6%94%B6", "mobileUrl": "https://www.baidu.com/s?wd=%E5%9B%BD%E4%BA%A7%E6%A6%B4%E8%8E%B2%E5%A4%A7%E4%B8%B0%E6%94%B6"}, {"id": 15, "title": "中医暂不纳入首批医保医疗服务目录", "desc": "目前，国家医保局正式方案作出结构性调整，首批医保医疗服务项目目录由11类调整为13类，中医暂不纳入首批编制范围。此前，国家医保局于今年5月发布相关征求意见稿。中医相关项目并非直接排除在国家目录之外。", "cover": "https://fyb-2.cdn.bcebos.com/hotboard_image/e2f94ae889e4669f106b9d632751607c", "author": "", "timestamp": 0, "hot": 6378059, "url": "https://www.baidu.com/s?wd=%E4%B8%AD%E5%8C%BB%E6%9A%82%E4%B8%8D%E7%BA%B3%E5%85%A5%E9%A6%96%E6%89%B9%E5%8C%BB%E4%BF%9D%E5%8C%BB%E7%96%97%E6%9C%8D%E5%8A%A1%E7%9B%AE%E5%BD%95", "mobileUrl": "https://www.baidu.com/s?wd=%E4%B8%AD%E5%8C%BB%E6%